{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53505","headline":"谢人送鲫鱼鱠 · 杨巨源","name":"谢人送鲫鱼鱠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君家一筯万钱𢬵，分我银丝侑客欢\n芳饵得来珍丙穴，金刀落处照辛盘。\n腹空羞迫诗肩瘦，鳞活能生酒面寒。\n玉手行厨如许巧，说教鱼婢学应难。\n（影印本《诗渊》第一册第一一三页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}